# CORE PRODUCT PHILOSOPHY

The application is a data-first admin/product interface.

It must remain:

* efficient
* professional
* visually polished
* modern
* responsive
* usable
* information-dense where appropriate
* visually impactful without becoming decorative
* consistent without becoming repetitive
* capable of evolving over time

Do NOT interpret "data-first" as "plain" or "boring".

Do NOT interpret "modern" as gradients, huge cards, excessive whitespace, glassmorphism, excessive radius, or decorative animation.

The UI should feel intentionally designed by an experienced product team.

